                    {
                        "id": "b54a4c7b-5e3f-456b-9942-35695d59604b",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "The main purpose of farmers is to supply food. \n\nAdditional facts:\n- Farmers are responsible for cultivating crops and raising livestock, which are essential for human consumption and various industries.\n- They contribute to the economy by providing raw materials for food processing, textile, and other industries.\n- Farmers also play a crucial role in maintaining the environment and preserving biodiversity.\n\nSub-questions:\n1) What are the different types of farming?\n2) How do farmers contribute to food production?\n3) What is the role of farmers in the economy and the environment?\n\n1) Types of farming:\n- Crop farming: Farmers grow various crops such as grains, vegetables, and fruits.\n- Livestock farming: Farmers raise animals like cattle, poultry, and pigs for meat, dairy, and other products.\n- Mixed farming: Farmers combine crop and livestock farming to maximize productivity and sustainability.\n\n2) Contribution to food production:\n- Farmers cultivate crops that provide essential nutrients for human consumption.\n- They raise livestock for meat, dairy, and other products that are important sources of protein and other nutrients.\n- Farmers use sustainable practices to ensure a continuous supply of food for the growing population.\n\n3) Role in the economy and the environment:\n- Farmers provide raw materials for various industries, contributing to economic growth.\n- They help maintain the environment by preserving soil fertility, managing water resources, and conserving biodiversity.\n- Farmers also contribute to rural development and employment opportunities.\n\nIn conclusion, the main purpose of farmers is to supply food by cultivating crops and raising livestock, while also contributing to the economy and maintaining the environment.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "abb89fd2-84d0-4eae-8322-9d4ad8820cf0",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "E) supply food.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "E",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/12 18:02:45",
