                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Professor, I'm having trouble understanding the main purpose of farmers. Can you help me work through this question?\n\nProfessor: Of course! Let's look at the options given. What do you think is the main purpose of farmers among these choices?\n\nStudent: Well, I think raising cattle, growing corn, and farming land are all things that farmers do, but I'm not sure if any of them are the main purpose.\n\nProfessor: That's a good observation. Let's break it down further. Why do farmers raise cattle and grow corn?\n\nStudent: I guess they do it to produce food for people to eat.\n\nProfessor: Exactly! Now, what about farming land? Why do they farm land?\n\nStudent: To grow crops and raise animals, which also provide food for people.\n\nProfessor: Right. So, if we look at the other options, driving tractors is just a means to help them farm more efficiently, but it's not their main purpose. So, what do you think the main purpose of farmers is, based on our discussion?\n\nStudent: I think the main purpose of farmers is to supply food.\n\nProfessor: That's correct! So, the answer is E) supply food. Do you understand how we arrived at this conclusion?\n\nStudent: Yes, I do. Thank you for helping me work through it step by step, Professor!",
