                        "cot": "Step 1: Read the question carefully and understand what it is asking.\nStep 2: Identify the key words in the question - in this case, \"travel\" and \"unexpected costs.\"\nStep 3: Look at the answer choices and eliminate any options that do not relate to the key words or the overall context of the question.\nStep 4: From the remaining answer choices, determine which one best addresses the issue of unexpected costs while traveling.\n\nAnswer: E) have money",
