                    {
                        "id": "dbcaba68-0812-4a6b-9c86-f6320991b8cc",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "When you travel, you should be prepared for unexpected costs. This is important because unforeseen expenses can arise during a trip, such as medical emergencies, lost luggage, or additional transportation costs. Being prepared for these situations can help reduce stress and ensure a more enjoyable travel experience.\n\nTo answer the original question, we need to consider the following sub-questions:\n1. What are some common unexpected costs that can occur during travel?\n2. How can one be prepared for these unexpected costs?\n\nSub-question 1: What are some common unexpected costs that can occur during travel?\nSome common unexpected costs during travel include:\n- Medical emergencies or accidents\n- Lost or stolen luggage\n- Additional transportation costs (e.g., taxis, buses, or trains)\n- Additional accommodation costs (e.g., due to flight cancellations or delays)\n- Currency exchange fees\n\nSub-question 2: How can one be prepared for these unexpected costs?\nTo be prepared for unexpected costs during travel, one can:\n- Set aside an emergency fund specifically for unexpected expenses\n- Purchase travel insurance that covers medical emergencies, lost luggage, and trip cancellations or delays\n- Carry a credit card with a sufficient limit to cover unforeseen expenses\n- Research local transportation options and costs before traveling\n- Be aware of currency exchange rates and fees\n\nAnswering the original question:\nWhen you travel, you should E) have money in case of unexpected costs. This can be in the form of an emergency fund, travel insurance, or a credit card with a sufficient limit. Being prepared for unexpected costs can help ensure a more enjoyable and stress-free travel experience.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "751b41a9-8b26-4ba5-b16c-d7eaf5a4a778",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
