                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Read the statement carefully.\n\"Sage loved communicating.\"\n\nStep 2: Identify the keyword(s) in the statement.\n\"communicating\"\n\nStep 3: Analyze the options and find the one that is most related to the keyword(s).\n\nA) exchanging ideas - This is related to communication as it involves sharing thoughts and information with others.\n\nB) confusion - This is not related to communication, as it implies a lack of understanding or clarity.\n\nC) peer pressure - This is not directly related to communication, as it refers to the influence of others on one's behavior or decisions.\n\nD) response - This is somewhat related to communication, as it involves reacting to something someone else has said or done. However, it is not as directly related to the keyword as option A.\n\nE) learning - This is not directly related to communication, as it refers to acquiring knowledge or skills.\n\nStep 4: Choose the best option based on the analysis.\nThe best option is A) exchanging ideas, as it is the most directly related to the keyword \"communicating.\"",
