                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To determine what Sage loved doing with his peers, let's analyze each option:\n\nA) exchanging ideas - This option suggests that Sage enjoyed sharing and discussing thoughts and concepts with his peers. This aligns with the fact that he loved communicating.\n\nB) confusion - This option does not align with the idea of loving communication, as confusion typically results from a lack of clear communication.\n\nC) peer pressure - This option also does not align with the idea of loving communication, as peer pressure is a negative aspect of social interaction and not directly related to communication.\n\nD) response - This option is somewhat related to communication, as responses are part of a conversation. However, it does not fully capture the idea of enjoying communication with peers.\n\nE) learning - This option suggests that Sage enjoyed gaining knowledge from his peers. While this may be related to communication, it does not directly address the aspect of enjoying communication itself.\n\nBased on this analysis, the best answer is:\n\nA) exchanging ideas",
