                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: What did Sage enjoy doing with his peers?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step by spelling out our thoughts and reasoning:\n\nA) exchanging ideas - This option seems plausible, as it involves communication, which Sage loves.\nB) confusion - This option does not seem relevant to communication or enjoyment.\nC) peer pressure - This option also does not seem relevant to communication or enjoyment.\nD) response - This option is related to communication, but it is not clear if it is something Sage enjoys doing with his peers.\nE) learning - This option could be related to communication, but it is not explicitly stated that Sage enjoys learning with his peers.\n\nBased on our analysis, the most suitable answer is:\n\nA) exchanging ideas",
                        "answers": [
