                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "If I am not well rested and it's a rainy day, I would most likely choose option A, which is to sleep. This is because being tired can negatively affect my mood and productivity, and sleeping is a good way to recharge and feel better. Additionally, the rainy weather may make me feel more relaxed and cozy, which could make it easier to fall asleep. \n\nOption B, which is to write, may not be the best choice if I am feeling tired, as it requires mental energy and focus. Option C, making bread, may be enjoyable but also requires effort and time. Option D, staying in bed, is similar to option A but may not be as restful if I am not actually sleeping. Option E, enjoying a film, could be a good choice if I am not feeling too tired, but may not be as restful as sleeping. \n\nOverall, based on my personal preferences and needs, I would choose option A to sleep if I am not well rested and it's a rainy day.",
