                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: Rainy days can often make people feel more tired and less motivated to be active. Rest and relaxation can be beneficial on these types of days.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. Why might someone not be well rested?\n2. What are the benefits of sleeping?\n3. What are the benefits of writing?\n4. What are the benefits of making bread?\n5. What are the benefits of staying in bed?\n6. What are the benefits of enjoying a film?\n\nAnswers:\n1. Someone might not be well rested due to a variety of reasons such as stress, insomnia, or a busy schedule.\n2. Sleeping can help improve mood, memory, and overall health. It can also reduce stress and improve cognitive function.\n3. Writing can be a creative outlet and a way to express emotions. It can also improve communication skills and help with problem-solving.\n4. Making bread can be a relaxing and therapeutic activity. It can also provide a sense of accomplishment and satisfaction.\n5. Staying in bed can be a way to rest and recharge. It can also provide a sense of comfort and security.\n6. Enjoying a film can be a way to escape reality and relax. It can also provide entertainment and stimulate the imagination.\n\nAnswer: If you aren't well rested and it's a rainy day, you might choose to sleep, stay in bed, or enjoy a film as these activities can provide rest and relaxation. Making bread or writing may also be enjoyable and therapeutic activities to do on a rainy day.",
