                        "cot": "Question: If you are not well-rested and it is a rainy day, what activity might you engage in?\nA) sleep\nB) write\nC) make bread\nD) stay in bed\nE) enjoy a movie\n\nStep 1: Identify the conditions given in the question - not well-rested and rainy day.\nStep 2: Consider which activities are suitable for someone who is not well-rested and during a rainy day.\nStep 3: Evaluate each option based on the conditions.\n\nA) Sleep - This is a suitable activity for someone who is not well-rested, and the rainy day doesn't affect this option.\nB) Write - This activity can be done indoors during a rainy day, but it might not be the best option for someone who is not well-rested.\nC) Make bread - This activity can also be done indoors, but it requires some effort and might not be suitable for someone who is not well-rested.\nD) Stay in bed - This is a suitable activity for someone who is not well-rested, and the rainy day doesn't affect this option.\nE) Enjoy a movie - This activity can be done indoors during a rainy day and doesn't require much effort, making it suitable for someone who is not well-rested.\n\nAnswer: Based on the given conditions, the most suitable activities for someone who is not well-rested on a rainy day are A) sleep, D) stay in bed, and E) enjoy a movie.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "1b0b012a-f0b8-412e-b61c-f3a2d94affb7",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
