                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to consider the factors that influence the decision: not being well-rested and the rainy weather. We also need to evaluate each option based on these factors.\n\nA) Sleep: Since you are not well-rested, sleeping would be a suitable option to help you recover and feel better.\n\nB) Write: Writing can be a relaxing indoor activity that can be done regardless of the weather. If you enjoy writing and feel that it would not be too mentally taxing given your lack of rest, this could be a good option.\n\nC) Make bread: Making bread is an indoor activity that can be enjoyable and productive. However, it can also be physically demanding and time-consuming, which may not be ideal if you are not well-rested.\n\nD) Stay in bed: Staying in bed can be a way to rest and relax without necessarily sleeping. This option allows you to take it easy and potentially engage in other low-energy activities like reading or watching TV.\n\nE) Enjoy film: Watching a film is another indoor activity that can be relaxing and enjoyable on a rainy day. This option allows you to stay entertained without exerting too much energy.\n\nBased on the factors of not being well-rested and the rainy weather, the most suitable options would be A) Sleep, D) Stay in bed, and E) Enjoy film. These options allow you to rest and engage in low-energy activities that are not affected by the weather.",
                        "answers": [
