                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: The little boy doesn't know the reason for something.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What did the little boy say when asked why?\n- He replied that he didn't know.\n2. Did the little boy provide any explanation?\n- No, he didn't.\n3. What is the question asking for?\n- It's asking for the little boy's response after saying he didn't know.\n\nAnswer: D) because. The little boy replied that he didn't know the reason, so the answer to the question is \"because.\"",
