                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question\nThe question is asking for the word that best completes the sentence, which is about a little boy's response to his mother's question.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the options\nA) case - This option doesn't fit well in the sentence.\nB) reason - This option could work, as it would mean the boy doesn't know the reason for something.\nC) how - This option doesn't fit well in the sentence.\nD) because - This option could also work, as it would mean the boy doesn't know why something happened and it's just because it happened.\nE) answer - This option doesn't fit well in the sentence.\n\nStep 3: Choose the best option\nBetween options B and D, option B (reason) fits better in the context of the sentence. The sentence would read: \"She asked her little boy why, he replied that he didn't know and it was just the reason.\"\n\nAnswer: B) reason",
