                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: The mother asked her son why he did something, and he replied that he didn't know. What word best describes his response?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step, spelling out our thoughts and reasoning:\n\nA) Case - This word refers to an instance or situation, but it doesn't fit the context of the boy's response.\nB) Reason - This word could work, as the boy is providing a reason for his actions (or lack thereof).\nC) How - This word refers to the manner in which something is done, but it doesn't fit the context of the boy's response.\nD) Because - This word is used to introduce a reason or explanation, but it doesn't fit the context of the boy's response.\nE) Answer - This word refers to a response to a question, which is what the boy is providing.\n\nAfter analyzing each option, the best choice is:\n\nE) Answer",
