                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: In which location was the teacher playing the upright piano and explaining the song to all the students?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step by spelling out our thoughts and reasoning:\n\nA) music room - This is a possible location for a teacher to play the piano and explain a song to students.\nB) bathroom - This is an unlikely location for a teacher to play the piano and explain a song to students.\nC) house - This is a possible location, but it is too general and does not specify a particular room.\nD) living room - This is a possible location for a teacher to play the piano and explain a song to students, but it is less likely than a music room.\nE) music store - This is an unlikely location for a teacher to play the piano and explain a song to students.\n\nBased on our reasoning, the most likely answer is A) music room.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "e3fd14cc-4626-459b-9913-3081783766a6",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "A) music room.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "A",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
