                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to determine the most appropriate location for a teacher to be playing an upright piano and explaining a song to students.\n\nAdditional facts:\n1. Upright pianos are typically found in music rooms, living rooms, and music stores.\n2. Teachers usually teach students in a classroom or educational setting.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. Is it likely for a teacher to be teaching students in a bathroom? No, a bathroom is not an appropriate location for teaching.\n2. Is it likely for a teacher to be teaching students in a house? It's possible, but not as common as a classroom or educational setting.\n3. Is it likely for a teacher to be teaching students in a living room? It's possible, but not as common as a classroom or educational setting.\n4. Is it likely for a teacher to be teaching students in a music store? It's possible, but not as common as a classroom or educational setting.\n\nConsidering the additional facts and answers to the sub-questions, the most appropriate answer is:\n\nA) music room",
                        "answers": [
