                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: Current events refer to recent and important happenings in the world, such as news, politics, and social issues. \n\nAdditional fact: Print items refer to materials that are printed on paper, such as books, magazines, and newspapers. \n\nSub-questions: \n1. What are print items? \n2. What are current events? \n3. How do human beings learn about current events? \n\nAnswering sub-question 1: \nPrint items are materials that are printed on paper, such as books, magazines, and newspapers. \n\nAnswering sub-question 2: \nCurrent events refer to recent and important happenings in the world, such as news, politics, and social issues. \n\nAnswering sub-question 3: \nHuman beings learn about current events from various sources, such as television news, radio broadcasts, social media, and print items. However, the most common print item that people use to learn about current events is newspapers. Therefore, the answer to the original question is C) read newspapers.",
