                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "What would be the likely consequence if someone were to start killing people?\nA) They would feel guilty.\nB) They would receive a prison sentence.\nC) They would feel terrible.\nD) They would receive encouragement.\nE) They would die.\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- The question is asking about the consequence of starting to kill people.\n- Option A, \"feelings of guilt,\" is a common emotional response to taking someone's life and is a likely consequence.\n- Option B, \"prison sentence,\" is a legal consequence for committing murder.\n- Option C, \"terrible,\" is a vague term but could refer to the emotional and psychological toll of taking someone's life.\n- Option D, \"encouragement,\" is unlikely as killing people is illegal and morally wrong.\n- Option E, \"die,\" is a possible consequence if the person is killed in self-defense or by law enforcement.\n\nThe correct answers are A) feelings of guilt and B) prison sentence.",
                        "answers": [
