                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Can you explain the question again, please?\n\nProfessor: Sure. The question is asking what would happen if you started killing people. What would be the likely consequence?\n\nStudent: Okay, got it. So, what are the options?\n\nProfessor: The options are A) feelings of guilt, B) prison sentence, C) terrible, D) encouragement, or E) die.\n\nStudent: Hmm, I think it's either A or B. Can you explain them both?\n\nProfessor: Of course. A) feelings of guilt means that you would feel bad about what you did. B) prison sentence means that you would be punished by the law and sent to jail.\n\nStudent: Okay, I understand. So, if I chose B, what would happen next?\n\nProfessor: If you chose B, you would receive a prison sentence. This means that you would be taken to court, and if found guilty, you would be sent to jail for a certain amount of time.\n\nStudent: And what if I chose A?\n\nProfessor: If you chose A, you would feel guilty about what you did. This means that you would have a moral conscience and understand that what you did was wrong.\n\nStudent: I see. So, what would happen if I chose D?\n\nProfessor: If you chose D, you would receive encouragement. This means that someone would be supporting you in your actions, which is not a good thing in this case.\n\nStudent: Okay, I understand now. Thank you for explaining it to me step by step.",
                        "answers": [
