                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question - The question is asking what consequence is likely to happen if someone starts killing people.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the answer choices - We need to determine which of the given options is the most likely consequence of killing people.\n\nA) feelings of guilt - This is a possible emotional consequence, but not the most likely overall consequence.\nB) prison sentence - This is a legal consequence and is very likely to happen if someone is caught killing people.\nC) terrible - This is not a complete answer and does not make sense in the context of the question.\nD) encouragement - This is highly unlikely, as killing people is generally not encouraged by society.\nE) die - This could be a possible consequence if the person is killed in self-defense or receives the death penalty, but it is not the most likely consequence.\n\nStep 3: Choose the most likely consequence - Based on the analysis, the most likely consequence of killing people is a prison sentence.\n\nAnswer: B) prison sentence",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "f42687d1-f17b-478b-bd38-4136bef44a32",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "B) prison sentence",
                                "answer_from_choices": "B",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/12 20:06:31",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-4', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
                        "comment": "",
                        "annotations": []
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "dfebd3ec-3e3d-4e53-9439-c76138c2ec81",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-12",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "If you were to start killing people, you would likely receive:\n\nA) feelings of guilt - It is natural for humans to feel guilt or remorse when causing harm to others, especially in such an extreme way as taking someone's life.\n\nB) prison sentence - Killing people is a serious crime, and if caught, you would likely be arrested, tried in court, and sentenced to prison for a significant amount of time, depending on the circumstances and jurisdiction.\n\nC) terrible - This option is not a complete sentence or thought, so it is unclear what it is referring to. However, it could be assumed that the consequences of killing people would be terrible for both the victims and the perpetrator.\n\nD) encouragement - It is highly unlikely that you would receive encouragement for killing people, as it is a morally reprehensible act that is condemned by society.\n\nE) die - If you were to start killing people, there is a possibility that you could be killed yourself, either by someone trying to stop you or as a result of a death penalty sentence if convicted in a jurisdiction that allows capital punishment.\n\nBased on these explanations, the most likely consequences of killing people would be feelings of guilt (A) and a prison sentence (B).",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "5e1146d6-ab30-4e22-b64b-8f63d03e6404",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "A) feelings of guilt and B) prison sentence.",
                                "answer_from_choices": null,
                                "correct_answer": null
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
