                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: What was Sally bored with because she didn't like the junk on it?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step by spelling out our thoughts and reasoning:\n\nA) drawer - This option doesn't seem to fit the context of being bored.\nB) garage - This option also doesn't seem to fit the context of being bored.\nC) caddy - This option is not related to boredom.\nD) bed - This option doesn't seem to fit the context of being bored.\nE) television - This option makes sense in the context of being bored, as someone might be bored if they don't like what's on TV.\n\nAfter analyzing each option, we can conclude that the right answer is:\n\nE) television",
