 melanoma, which increases her risk for all types of melanoma.\n- She has no abnormal moles or warts, which suggests that she may not have lentigo maligna melanoma.\n- She works in a law firm and travels to the Carribean regularly with her husband, which suggests that she may have some sun exposure and therefore may be at risk",
