                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStudent: Professor, I'm not sure how to answer this question. Could you walk me through it?\n\nProfessor: Sure. Let's start with process A. Would you be able to convert ferrous iron to ferric iron?\n\nStudent: I don't think so.\n\nProfessor: Okay, let's try process B. Would you be able to convert porphobilinogen to hydroxymethylbilane?\n\nStudent: I'm not sure.\n\nProfessor: Well, let's try process C. Would you be able to convert aminolevulinic acid to porphobilinogen?\n\nStudent: I don't think so.\n\nProfessor: Well, let's try process D. Would you be able to convert homocysteine to methionine?\n\nStudent: I'm not sure.\n\nProfessor: Well, let's try process E. Would you be able to convert uroporphyrinogen III to coproporphyrinogen III?\n\nStudent: I don't think so.\n\nProfessor: Well, it looks like the most likely impaired process in this patient is conversion of porphobilinogen to hydroxymethylbilane.",
