                    {
                        "id": "969ea0f8-cebd-461d-8661-253d3d210744",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nFacts: \n- Patient is 35-year-old female\n- Symptoms started 3 hours ago\n- Returned from Europe 3 days ago\n- Smokes a pack of cigarettes daily for 10 years\n- On oral contraceptive\n- Temperature is 38.0\u00b0C (100.4\u00b0F)\n- Pulse is 115/min and regular\n- Blood pressure is 155/85 mm Hg\n- Decreased muscle strength on entire right side\n- Deep tendon reflexes are 4+ on the right\n- Babinski sign is present on the right\n- Left lower leg is swollen, erythematous, and tender to palpation\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is the most likely cause of the patient's symptoms?\n2. What further evaluation is necessary to confirm the diagnosis?\n\nAnswer: D) Atrial fibrillation\n\nThe patient's symptoms are most likely caused by atrial fibrillation, a type of arrhythmia. Atrial fibrillation is a common cause of stroke, and the patient's symptoms of sudden weakness of the right arm and leg, decreased muscle strength on the entire right side, deep tendon reflexes of 4+ on the right, and Babinski sign present on the right are all consistent with a stroke. Additionally, the patient's recent travel to Europe, smoking history, and use of oral contraceptives are all risk factors for atrial fibrillation. The patient's left lower leg being swollen, erythematous, and tender to palpation is also consistent with atrial fibrillation.\n\nFurther evaluation is necessary to confirm the diagnosis, such as an electrocardiogram (ECG) to assess the patient's heart rhythm, a transthoracic echocardiogram (TTE) to assess the heart valves, and a carotid ultrasound to assess for carotid artery dissection.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "eb667648-2a8a-4bb4-935b-c21279810fab",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
