                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's use step by step inductive reasoning, given the medical nature of the question. \n\nThe first thing the question asks is what the next step in this patient's management is. The options given are all medical procedures, so the answer must be another medical procedure. \n\nThe second thing to consider is the information given about the patient. The patient is a 55-year-old man with a severe cough and difficulty breathing. He also has a history of a heart attack. Based on this information, it is likely that the patient's current symptoms are related to his heart. \n\nThe third thing to consider is the options given. Computed Tomography (CT) and Echocardiogram are both imaging tests that would be used to look at the patient's heart. Stress test is a test that is used to see how well the heart is working. Cardiac biopsy is a procedure in which a small sample of tissue is taken from the heart. \n\nBased on the information given, the best next step in this patient's management would be an Echocardiogram.",
