                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to first identify the patient's condition and then determine the associated acid-base disturbance. \n\nImportant additional facts:\n1. The patient is a 1-month-old girl.\n2. She has persistent vomiting, dehydration, and irritability.\n3. She has a palpable olive-shaped mass in the epigastric region.\n\nBased on these facts, the patient is likely suffering from pyloric stenosis, a condition in which the opening between the stomach and the small intestine (the pylorus) becomes narrowed, causing projectile vomiting and dehydration.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What are the common acid-base disturbances associated with pyloric stenosis?\n2. Which of the given options matches the acid-base disturbance associated with pyloric stenosis?\n\nAnswer to sub-question 1:\nPyloric stenosis is commonly associated with metabolic alkalosis. This occurs because the persistent vomiting leads to a loss of gastric acid (hydrochloric acid), which results in an increase in blood bicarbonate levels and a decrease in hydrogen ion concentration, causing alkalosis.\n\nAnswer to sub-question 2:\nComparing the given options with the answer to sub-question 1, we find that option C) Metabolic alkalosis matches the acid-base disturbance associated with pyloric stenosis.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C) Metabolic alkalosis.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "757d234c-5426-4754-814a-ed4bd4980602",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) Metabolic alkalosis.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "C",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/12 22:15:55",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-4', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
                        "comment": "",
