                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to first identify the most likely diagnosis for the patient and then determine the appropriate treatment and level of care required.\n\nImportant additional facts:\n1. The patient is 66 years old and has a history of diabetes and hypertension, which puts him at higher risk for infections and complications.\n2. He presents with a cough, fatigue, confusion, fever, and crackles on pulmonary exam, which are suggestive of a respiratory infection, most likely pneumonia.\n3. His vital signs show tachycardia (pulse 120/min) and low blood pressure (107/58 mmHg), which may indicate sepsis or dehydration.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is the most likely diagnosis for this patient?\n2. What is the appropriate antibiotic treatment for the suspected diagnosis?\n3. What level of care is required for this patient?\n\nAnswers to sub-questions:\n1. The most likely diagnosis for this patient is community-acquired pneumonia (CAP), given his symptoms and physical exam findings.\n2. The appropriate antibiotic treatment for CAP in a patient with comorbidities like diabetes and hypertension is a combination of a beta-lactam antibiotic (e.g., ceftriaxone) and a macrolide antibiotic (e.g., azithromycin).\n3. Given the patient's age, comorbidities, and vital signs (tachycardia and low blood pressure), he is at higher risk for complications and should be admitted to the hospital for close monitoring and treatment. The intensive care unit (ICU) may be necessary if the patient's condition worsens or if he develops signs of severe sepsis or respiratory failure.\n\nAnswer to the original question:\nD) Ceftriaxone, azithromycin, and admission to the intensive care unit",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "cc388361-ae25-441e-9fea-be4564c118ae",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
