                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": " D. The patient's presentation is consistent with a possible pneumonia, and ceftriaxone and azithromycin are the recommended antibiotics for this condition. Additionally, given the patient's age and the severity of his symptoms, admission to the intensive care unit is the most appropriate course of action.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "D",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
