                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe first step is to review the lab values that were obtained. The platelet count is within normal limits, the bleeding time is slightly prolonged, and the prothrombin time and activated partial thromboplastin time are both within normal limits. The factor VIII activity and ristocetin cofactor assay are both decreased.\n\nBased on this information, the most likely aspect of coagulation that would be affected is Factor VIII.",
