                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe most likely aspect of coagulation that would be affected is Factor VIII activity, as this was the only value that was decreased in the screening lab work. Factor VIII is a critical component of the coagulation cascade, and its decreased activity would lead to a decrease in the other coagulation factors. Therefore, the correct answer is A) Factor IX.",
