                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nAnswer: D) Vitamin K\n\nExplanation: The patient's lab results indicate a decreased Factor VIII activity and decreased Ristocetin cofactor assay, which are both associated with Vitamin K deficiency. Vitamin K is a cofactor for the production of clotting factors II, VII, IX, and X, so it is likely that the patient's coagulation would be affected by a Vitamin K deficiency.",
