                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStudent: What aspect of coagulation would most likely be affected?\n\nProfessor: Based on the lab values you provided, it appears that the patient has a decreased Factor VIII activity and a decreased Ristocetin cofactor assay. This suggests that the patient has a deficiency in Factor VIII, which is a part of the intrinsic pathway of coagulation. Therefore, the answer to your question is A) Factor IX.",
