nk is most likely?\n\nStudent: I think the most likely additional finding is D) Increased CA 19-9 levels.\n\nProfessor: That's correct! The patient's age, symptoms, and lab results are most consistent with pancreatic cancer, which can cause liver dysfunction and elevated CA 19-9 levels.",
