                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "B) Call the ethics board of the hospital to discuss the issue. This allows for a more informed decision while considering the patient's wishes and the ethical implications of the situation.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "B",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
